# BOEA — Firebase config (Analytics + Admin Auth + live CMS)
# Full walkthrough: FIREBASE_SETUP.md
# 1. Create a project at https://console.firebase.google.com
# 2. Enable Realtime Database AND Authentication → Email/Password
# 3. Create the admin user in Authentication → Users (the only admin key;
#    no password lives in this repo anymore)
# 4. Fill these in from Project Settings → Your apps → Web app
# 5. Add the same vars in Vercel → Environment Variables, then redeploy
# 6. Publish database.rules.json in Realtime Database → Rules

VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_DATABASE_URL=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
